    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shells is a geometry puzzle game about the elegance of nested pieces on a tiny board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your block into larger shells to rearrange the board and find your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Simple core mechanics and deep emergent complexity packed into a compact 4x4 grid. Train your brain by challenging your problem solving and spatial reasoning skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Gradual difficulty curve featuring over 360 original levels spread across 8 distinct worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Flexible progression structure with multiple levels to choose from at any given point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Adjust the difficulty to your liking with the optional hint system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Soothing piano soundtrack accompanied by relaxing sound effects and backgrounds.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shells is a geometry puzzle game about the elegance of nested pieces on a tiny board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your block into larger shells to rearrange the board and find your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Simple core mechanics and deep emergent complexity packed into a compact 4x4 grid. Train your brain by challenging your problem solving and spatial reasoning skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Gradual difficulty curve featuring over 360 original levels spread across 8 distinct worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Flexible progression structure with multiple levels to choose from at any given point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Adjust the difficulty to your liking with the optional hint system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Soothing piano soundtrack accompanied by relaxing sound effects and backgrounds.</p>",
